//Automate qui traque le joueurs en évitant les Obstacle (pour l'instant est bloqué si cul-de-sac et ne peut pas fuir)



Blinky(Think){

* (Tracking):
| Closest(@,N) & !Step(N,O)? Move(N) :(Tracking)
| Closest(@,N) & !Step(E,O)? Move(E) :(Tracking)
| Closest(@,N) & !Step(W,O)? Move(W) :(Tracking)
/////
| Closest(@,S) & !Step(S,O)? Move(S) :(Tracking)
| Closest(@,S) & !Step(E,O)? Move(E) :(Tracking)
| Closest(@,S) & !Step(W,O)? Move(W) :(Tracking)
/////
| Closest(@,E) & !Step(E,O)? Move(E) :(Tracking)
| Closest(@,E) & !Step(N,O)? Move(N) :(Tracking)
| Closest(@,E) & !Step(S,O)? Move(S) :(Tracking)
/////
| Closest(@,W) & !Step(W,O)? Move(W) :(Tracking)
| Closest(@,W) & !Step(N,O)? Move(N) :(Tracking)
| Closest(@,W) & !Step(S,O)? Move(S) :(Tracking)

}
